		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 Chip resistor x1: needs R = 511kΩ. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 4695, 0.0055 USD each at 1. R 511kΩ meets = 511kΩ (33 other candidates passed) Chosen because: TPS54202 EN divider upper resistor 511 k 1% 0603 from +12 V (TI reference design R4); with 105 k below, EN reaches its 1.21-1.28 V rising threshold at about 7 V in. The RC0603FR variant has only 12 in stock, so the AC0603FR (4,695) is used. JLC catalogue basis (passive)."
