		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 Ceramic capacitor (MLCC) x3: needs C >= 900nF, V rated >= 25V. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 40143, 0.0218 USD each at 3. C 1uF meets min 900nF; V rated 25V meets min 25V (1263 other candidates passed) Chosen because: Motor-1 bootstrap caps BSTx-SHx, 1 uF 25 V X7R 0603 (gate rail 12 V; datasheet BSTx to SHx abs max 21.5 V). Charge from a 39 nC max FET gate is about 40 mV even at half capacitance after bias derating. Prior art: memirmakar/foc-driver BOM_revB.csv uses 1 uF 25 V X7R for C_BST. JLC catalogue basis (passive)."
