		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 Ceramic capacitor (MLCC) x6: needs C = 1nF, V rated >= 50V. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 1344064, 0.0054 USD each at 6. C 1nF meets = 1nF; V rated 50V meets min 50V (484 other candidates passed) Chosen because: Output RC filter capacitor, 1 nF 50 V NP0/C0G 0603 per channel (C0G so the corner does not drift with DC bias or temperature), to the MCU ADC pin ground. JLC catalogue basis (passive)."
