				)
			)
		)
		(property "Wright.Note" "Footprint Inductor_SMD:L_Bourns_SRP1245A is a stand-in of the same 12.5 x 12.5 mm class: Taiyo Yuden NS12575T680MN's own land pattern drawing is not extractable from the datasheet text (terminals a 3.0 / b 2.0 mm). Land pattern NOT verified: replace with the Taiyo Yuden pattern (sync --swap) before fabrication."
