		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 Chip resistor x6: needs R = 33Ω. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 661133, 0.0033 USD each at 6. R 33Ω meets = 33Ω (232 other candidates passed) Chosen because: Motor-1 gate turn-on resistors, 33 ohm 1% 0603 (3 high-side, 3 low-side), provisional starting value from memirmakar/foc-driver BOM_revB.csv R_GON 33 ohm, to be tuned against phase ringing at bring-up. JLC catalogue basis (passive)."
