		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 TVS diode x1: needs Vrwm >= 45V, Vc <= 80V, Ppp >= 1.5kW. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 2993, 0.0714 USD each at 1. Vrwm 48V meets min 45V; Vc 77.4V meets max 80V; Ppp 1.5kW meets min 1.5kW (0 other candidates passed) Chosen because: Bus TVS, MPN SMCJ48A (JEDEC type): Vrwm 48 V above the 43.2 V charge voltage, Vc 77.4 V at 19.4 A under the 80 V bulk-cap rating. The tool recorded the Taisko catalogue row (JLC C20883370, 2993 in stock); the lifecycle evidence is for the Littelfuse SMCJ48A (Digi-Key Active, 5455 in stock, no successor; research/SMCJ48A.json). Buy the Littelfuse part to match that evidence; the Taisko row is only the catalogue match. Introduction date not found; SMCJ is a long-established SMC series with no newer type, so its age is expected. Replaces an earlier Brightking 5 kW pick whose lifecycle had only the JLC catalogue; 1.5 kW is the trade-off. Clips transients only, not sustained regen current."
