		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 Ceramic capacitor (MLCC) x2: needs C = 12pF, V rated >= 50V. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 774667, 0.0143 USD each at 2. C 12pF meets = 12pF; V rated 50V meets min 50V (103 other candidates passed) Chosen because: HSE load capacitors, 12 pF C0G 0603, one on OSC_IN and one on OSC_OUT: 2 x (CL 10 pF - 4 pF stray) = 12 pF for the K3A240001010 crystal. Stray capacitance is an estimate, so tune on the first board. JLC catalogue basis (passive)."
