		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 Ceramic capacitor (MLCC) x6: needs C = 100nF, V rated >= 25V. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 50349394, 0.0141 USD each at 6. C 100nF meets = 100nF; V rated 50V meets min 25V (528 other candidates passed) Chosen because: STM32G474 supply decoupling, 100 nF X7R 0603: one at each of the four VDD pins (LQFP64 pins 16, 32, 48, 64 per the datasheet pin table), one at VDDA/VREF+ (double-bonded on this package per the datasheet) and one at VBAT. JLC catalogue basis (passive)."
