		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 Ceramic capacitor (MLCC) x2: needs C >= 20uF, V rated >= 25V. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 6127, 0.3475 USD each at 2. C 22uF meets min 20uF; V rated 25V meets min 25V (94 other candidates passed) Chosen because: LM5164 output ceramics, 2 x 22 uF 25 V X7R 1210 per the TI reference design (table 7-1 lists TMK325B7226KMHT; this is the Taiyo Yuden TMK325B7226KMHP of the same value and series). 25 V against 12 V out; roughly half the capacitance remains at 12 V bias, which the reference design already assumes at 47 uF nominal. JLC catalogue basis (passive)."
