		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 Ceramic capacitor (MLCC) x1: needs C >= 20uF, V rated >= 25V. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 3360923, 0.2384 USD each at 1. C 22uF meets min 20uF; V rated 25V meets min 25V (96 other candidates passed) Chosen because: Motor-1 DRV8300U GVDD decoupling: datasheet asks >= 10 uF X5R/X7R local; a 22 uF 25 V 0805 keeps roughly 10 uF at the 12 V gate rail after bias derating. JLC catalogue basis (passive). Prior art uses 10 uF 25 V per driver."
