		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 Ceramic capacitor (MLCC) x6: needs C = 1nF, V rated >= 50V. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 1344064, 0.0054 USD each at 6. C 1nF meets = 1nF; V rated 50V meets min 50V (484 other candidates passed) Chosen because: Hall input filter capacitors, 1 nF 50 V NP0 0603, one per hall line, after the 1 k series resistor. JLC catalogue basis (passive)."
